(7682650, 1257428, 106110, '<td valign="top">I love the use of a foreground object with the great texture as a backdrop. I feel like the point of the hook pointing off tot he right is drawing my attention to the side of the image and it makes me Wes to to see more of that side. I think either moving the hook to the left of the photo or flipping it around so it draws the eye to a part of the image that is inside the frame would help take it up a notch.</td>', 'I love the use of a foreground object with the great texture as a backdrop. I feel like the point of the hook pointing off tot he right is drawing my attention to the side of the image and it makes me Wes to to see more of that side. I think either moving the hook to the left of the photo or flipping it around so it draws the eye to a part of the image that is inside the frame would help take it up a notch.', '2020-12-29 11:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
